anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882380/extras/5ee89fc67b44b698dc6d1aacbf03382e.poster.avif?t=1740357435\" width=500 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882380/extras/5ee89fc67b44b698dc6d1aacbf03382e.webm?t=1740357435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>OUR FURRY FRIEND<br>Adorable and loyal, he will follow you wherever you go. What more could you ask for? But first, we must rescue him so he can join us on our adventure.",
